# Modular monolith

Biga Fleet Manager is a **PIMS de frotas** (joke origin: locadora de bigas / JPA-JSF 2013). Domain language is **vehicle**, never chariot/biga in code.

Keep bounded contexts isolated. Do not leak Prisma models or trip lifecycle into the IoT gateway.

| Context | Path | Owns |
|---|---|---|
| Platform | `src/platform/` | Config, Prisma, Redis, Mongo connection, health, geo utils |
| Tenancy | `src/tenancy/` | Tenant entity, `x-tenant-id` context, tenant CRUD |
| Fleet | `src/fleet/` | Relational companies, vehicles, trips, dashboard |
| Ingestion | `src/ingestion/` | Protocol-agnostic IoT ingest: validate envelope, publish, return 202 |
| Telemetry | `src/telemetry/` | Mongo writes + trip lifecycle from the bus |

- Relational rows are **tenant-scoped**. Fleet queries always filter `tenantId`.
- Ingestion payload uses opaque `tenantId` + `deviceId`. No trip start/finish inside ingestion.
- Cross-context: Fleet may read telemetry collections; Telemetry may call Fleet trip APIs; Ingestion must not import Fleet.
